            <ArticleTitle>The 'absent' appendix.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>992</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>During an operation for suspected appendicitis, the surgeon concluded that the appendix was absent. The causes of this situation are presented and a guide to its management is suggested.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
